      "en": "### Greeting and Relationship Input\n\nHello. ｜ Hello, [Name]. ｜ Hi, teacher. ｜ Hi, friend. ｜ Good morning. ｜ Bye-bye. ｜ See you. ｜ Come here. ｜ Come to teacher. ｜ Sit with me.\n\n### Classroom Object Input\n\nchair ｜ table ｜ mat ｜ bag ｜ cup ｜ book ｜ toy ｜ box ｜ basket ｜ classroom ｜ class ｜ my bag ｜ your cup ｜ the book ｜ the toy\n\n### Action and Routine Input\n\nlook ｜ listen ｜ sit ｜ stand ｜ come ｜ show ｜ give ｜ take ｜ put ｜ clean up ｜ line up ｜ wait ｜ stop ｜ go ｜ all done\n\n### Teacher Routine Language\n\nCome here. ｜ Sit down. ｜ Stand up. ｜ Look at me. ｜ Listen. ｜ Show me. ｜ Give it to me. ｜ Take one. ｜ Put it in the box. ｜ Clean up. ｜ Line up. ｜ All done. ｜ Good job.",
